{"Users":[{"gcid":12119926,"realCID":11831444,"demoCID":13398853,"username":"Anders_","firstName":"Anders","middleName":null,"lastName":"Jensen","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I have been an eToro Top 2 most copied Popular Investor in USA continuously since 2020. I have a passion for the future of Bitcoin and the companies that are able to outperform Bitcoin by increasing the Bitcoin per share.\n\nI bought my first stock when I was 12 years old,. In those days a stock was a physical piece of paper.\n\nIn October 1997 I invested in Yahoo! In 1999 I invested in Amazon.\n\nWhen Google had been online for less than 4.5 months in January 1999 and had 10 employees I wrote to the email at the bottom of their homepage and asked if I could invest in the company. I got an email back saying that they had just received funding, but that he would let him know of any future opportunities. That \"he\" was Sergey Brin the Co-Founder of Google. Unfortunately I never heard back, but I did invest in them once they went public in 2005.\n\nNow I focus on Bitcoin and Bitcoin treasury companies, as I believe that this will be the biggest value growth for years to come.\n","aboutMeShort":"I invest in Bitcoin & Bitcoin proxies. Focus on long term (min 3-5 years) value creation. ","userBio":{"gcid":12119926,"aboutMe":"I have been an eToro Top 2 most copied Popular Investor in USA continuously since 2020. I have a passion for the future of Bitcoin and the companies that are able to outperform Bitcoin by increasing the Bitcoin per share.\n\nI bought my first stock when I was 12 years old,. In those days a stock was a physical piece of paper.\n\nIn October 1997 I invested in Yahoo! In 1999 I invested in Amazon.\n\nWhen Google had been online for less than 4.5 months in January 1999 and had 10 employees I wrote to the email at the bottom of their homepage and asked if I could invest in the company. I got an email back saying that they had just received funding, but that he would let him know of any future opportunities. That \"he\" was Sergey Brin the Co-Founder of Google. Unfortunately I never heard back, but I did invest in them once they went public in 2005.\n\nNow I focus on Bitcoin and Bitcoin treasury companies, as I believe that this will be the biggest value growth for years to come.\n","aboutMeShort":"I invest in Bitcoin & Bitcoin proxies. Focus on long term (min 3-5 years) value creation. ","languageCode":"en","strategyID":2},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/11831444/2.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/11831444/2.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/11831444/2.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/11831444/2.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Anders_-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Anders_-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Anders_-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"549c9efc9d507ac9910ed3925e7585e47b32e70e08990295da748f01064ed243","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":10849959,"realCID":10563241,"demoCID":12139036,"username":"rambod59","firstName":"Rambod","middleName":null,"lastName":"Hakhamaneshi","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I have been sharing market insights on eToro for over three years, offering an independent global macro framework. My aim is to provide followers with a comprehensive understanding of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Altcoins, as an asset class. I identify as an investor rather than a day trader.","aboutMeShort":"Rambod from California is a long-term investor with a primary focus on cryptocurrencies.","userBio":{"gcid":10849959,"aboutMe":"I have been sharing market insights on eToro for over three years, offering an independent global macro framework. My aim is to provide followers with a comprehensive understanding of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Altcoins, as an asset class. I identify as an investor rather than a day trader.","aboutMeShort":"Rambod from California is a long-term investor with a primary focus on cryptocurrencies.","languageCode":"en","strategyID":4},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/10563241/2.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/10563241/2.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/10563241/2.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/10563241/2.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/rambodh-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/rambodh-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/rambodh-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"7e750918b5ab835888649a8807263635b08a45f4fbddac4fc40348759bae8606","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":16098462,"realCID":15809470,"demoCID":17361457,"username":"victorlee448","firstName":"Victor","middleName":null,"lastName":"Lee","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"Hello everyone! My name is Victor Lee and 448 is my lucky number (two-term presidents). I graduated from Dartmouth College Cum Laude with a degree in Political Science, Philosophy, and Arabic. I am a businessman and stock investor. One of my best investments in 2020 was Bitcoin, and I am extremely bullish for crypto this year!\n\nIdentifying investments boil down to calculating value, and an intelligent investor can help guide you through the right decisions. Consider me to be your smart friend that helps you pass the most difficult classes like Calculus and Chemistry. Now instead of school, you are being tested on your ability to earn money and make profitable investments. Just as chemistry was confusing, crypto will be confusing. You can depend on me to earn profitable returns on intelligent investments! \n\nTo good fortunes for all that is yours and mine","aboutMeShort":"🎓Dartmouth College\n💰Crypto\n📚The Intelligent Investor\n🕰️ 5 yrs on etoro\n📈Global Tech\n","userBio":{"gcid":16098462,"aboutMe":"Hello everyone! My name is Victor Lee and 448 is my lucky number (two-term presidents). I graduated from Dartmouth College Cum Laude with a degree in Political Science, Philosophy, and Arabic. I am a businessman and stock investor. One of my best investments in 2020 was Bitcoin, and I am extremely bullish for crypto this year!\n\nIdentifying investments boil down to calculating value, and an intelligent investor can help guide you through the right decisions. Consider me to be your smart friend that helps you pass the most difficult classes like Calculus and Chemistry. Now instead of school, you are being tested on your ability to earn money and make profitable investments. Just as chemistry was confusing, crypto will be confusing. You can depend on me to earn profitable returns on intelligent investments! \n\nTo good fortunes for all that is yours and mine","aboutMeShort":"🎓Dartmouth College\n💰Crypto\n📚The Intelligent Investor\n🕰️ 5 yrs on etoro\n📈Global Tech\n","languageCode":"en","strategyID":7},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/15809470/20.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/15809470/20.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/15809470/20.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/15809470/20.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/victorlee448-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/victorlee448-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/victorlee448-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"2d9b648b9a4b5af1584d711da074897d7709b62267cd897f6a855162765930a7","CustomerRestrictions":[{"CID":15809470,"RestrictionTypeID":1,"ReasonID":1,"Occured":"2021-01-12T14:09:48.15Z"}]},{"gcid":10762998,"realCID":10475206,"demoCID":12056825,"username":"clefsphere","firstName":"Hugh","middleName":null,"lastName":"Bernard","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"Hi, I'm a successful trader for 7+ years and publisher of marketcast.wordpress.com. A lifelong fascination with financial markets has lead me to many exciting opportunities. These include a college degree in Finance, stock and options consultant, and programmer of my own indicators for technical analysis.\nI've been on eToro for more than 2 1/2 years. As of Nov. 30, 21 my total return is 986.56%!\n\nI found out about Bitcoin in 2013 and I knew it was way different!\nDigital currency that doesn't need banks. Limited supply. Instant payments.  Store of value.  Accessible to everyone. I could see it being world-changing.   Now, other crypto coins have come along and they're mind-blowing in their own right, I've even mined a few of them along the way!\n\nI believe it's just getting started, financially and in all kinds of new innovations - in much the same way the internet changed everything. Anything is possible!\n\nWow, to my copiers! I care about you and it matters to me that you succeed too!","aboutMeShort":null,"userBio":{"gcid":10762998,"aboutMe":"Hi, I'm a successful trader for 7+ years and publisher of marketcast.wordpress.com. A lifelong fascination with financial markets has lead me to many exciting opportunities. These include a college degree in Finance, stock and options consultant, and programmer of my own indicators for technical analysis.\nI've been on eToro for more than 2 1/2 years. As of Nov. 30, 21 my total return is 986.56%!\n\nI found out about Bitcoin in 2013 and I knew it was way different!\nDigital currency that doesn't need banks. Limited supply. Instant payments.  Store of value.  Accessible to everyone. I could see it being world-changing.   Now, other crypto coins have come along and they're mind-blowing in their own right, I've even mined a few of them along the way!\n\nI believe it's just getting started, financially and in all kinds of new innovations - in much the same way the internet changed everything. Anything is possible!\n\nWow, to my copiers! I care about you and it matters to me that you succeed too!","aboutMeShort":null,"languageCode":"en","strategyID":null},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/10475206/1.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/10475206/1.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/10475206/1.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/10475206/1.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/clefsphere-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/clefsphere-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/clefsphere-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"1760b37552c06a0a6e6f799828fca68ea55f6dc8f678190bcb749547c60d8d2b","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":10957492,"realCID":10670739,"demoCID":12243719,"username":"troylindsey","firstName":"troy","middleName":null,"lastName":"lindsey","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"Troy navigates the tumultuous seas of cryptocurrency with the grace of a seasoned mariner, his soul anchored in the wisdom of patience and foresight. He sees beyond the fleeting chaos of market dips and rises, embracing the journey with a poet's heart and a warrior's resolve. His commitment to this digital odyssey is not driven by the shallow thirst for quick gains but by a deep-seated belief in the transformative power of blockchain technology. As a small business owner and musician, he has felt the sting of lost earnings, yet his spirit remains unbroken, guided by the light of long-term vision. Troy's approach to investment is a dance with destiny, a testament to his faith in the unseen future, and a reminder that true wealth lies not in the accumulation of assets but in the courage to pursue one's dreams against all odds.","aboutMeShort":"Troy navigates the tumultuous seas of cryptocurrency with the grace of a seasoned mariner,","userBio":{"gcid":10957492,"aboutMe":"Troy navigates the tumultuous seas of cryptocurrency with the grace of a seasoned mariner, his soul anchored in the wisdom of patience and foresight. He sees beyond the fleeting chaos of market dips and rises, embracing the journey with a poet's heart and a warrior's resolve. His commitment to this digital odyssey is not driven by the shallow thirst for quick gains but by a deep-seated belief in the transformative power of blockchain technology. As a small business owner and musician, he has felt the sting of lost earnings, yet his spirit remains unbroken, guided by the light of long-term vision. Troy's approach to investment is a dance with destiny, a testament to his faith in the unseen future, and a reminder that true wealth lies not in the accumulation of assets but in the courage to pursue one's dreams against all odds.","aboutMeShort":"Troy navigates the tumultuous seas of cryptocurrency with the grace of a seasoned mariner,","languageCode":"en","strategyID":5},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/10670739/3.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/10670739/3.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/10670739/3.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/10670739/3.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/troylindsey-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/troylindsey-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/troylindsey-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"030e773e0318ee55ded4b4ef91fa97755b513b3a1ac3274b5b3e490098687dac","CustomerRestrictions":[{"CID":10670739,"RestrictionTypeID":1,"ReasonID":1,"Occured":"2021-11-17T16:17:50.037Z"}]},{"gcid":30119815,"realCID":29836397,"demoCID":31331461,"username":"DanielHagberry","firstName":"Daniel","middleName":null,"lastName":"Hagberry","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":" Our strategy is built on patience and deep research. Before we make any investment, we listen to the companies conference calls and meticulously research their financials to ensure we understand the value. We then focus on long-term value in Growth, Dividend, and Blue Chip stocks, committed to a minimum 1-year holding period to allow compounding to work.\n\nWe strongly suggest our copiers also listen to the conference calls and review the core financials—understanding the investment is key to managing long-term volatility.\n\n Please remember that volatility is normal. We utilize stop-losses to protect capital, but we urge you to maintain a long-term view.\n\nThank you for your trust. Let's grow together\n\n\nListening and learning from the market\n","aboutMeShort":"Long term relationship with Miss Market.","userBio":{"gcid":30119815,"aboutMe":" Our strategy is built on patience and deep research. Before we make any investment, we listen to the companies conference calls and meticulously research their financials to ensure we understand the value. We then focus on long-term value in Growth, Dividend, and Blue Chip stocks, committed to a minimum 1-year holding period to allow compounding to work.\n\nWe strongly suggest our copiers also listen to the conference calls and review the core financials—understanding the investment is key to managing long-term volatility.\n\n Please remember that volatility is normal. We utilize stop-losses to protect capital, but we urge you to maintain a long-term view.\n\nThank you for your trust. Let's grow together\n\n\nListening and learning from the market\n","aboutMeShort":"Long term relationship with Miss Market.","languageCode":"en","strategyID":5},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/29836397/2.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/29836397/2.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/29836397/2.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/29836397/2.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"d8f0d3ef704d831aafce291d02c57d0decec4367122791783f97588ab40d2fb6","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":10905818,"realCID":10619067,"demoCID":12192995,"username":"Baqner","firstName":"Backner","middleName":null,"lastName":"Rivera","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I am not a day trader. My investing strategy is simple: instead of trying to time the market I will work with the markets and stake fluctuations. \n\nThere is no model that will consistently beat the market - in a long-term model I am not interested in \"beating\" the market, rather having a strong presence. This is done by taking small, frequent bites. No bite is small enough to be insignificant nor too big to impact my entire portfolio.\n\nI am going after a steady pace, not a series of highs and lows.\n\nGood luck!\n\nI'm a Popular Investor. Learn more about the program here: https://www.etoro.com/en-us/copytrader/popular-investor/","aboutMeShort":"Hold-heavy, value investing is the game.","userBio":{"gcid":10905818,"aboutMe":"I am not a day trader. My investing strategy is simple: instead of trying to time the market I will work with the markets and stake fluctuations. \n\nThere is no model that will consistently beat the market - in a long-term model I am not interested in \"beating\" the market, rather having a strong presence. This is done by taking small, frequent bites. No bite is small enough to be insignificant nor too big to impact my entire portfolio.\n\nI am going after a steady pace, not a series of highs and lows.\n\nGood luck!\n\nI'm a Popular Investor. Learn more about the program here: https://www.etoro.com/en-us/copytrader/popular-investor/","aboutMeShort":"Hold-heavy, value investing is the game.","languageCode":"en","strategyID":5},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/10619067/1.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/10619067/1.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/10619067/1.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/10619067/1.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Baqner-desktop-1920x1080.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Baqner-thumbnail-300x300.jpg","width":300,"height":300,"type":"Retouched"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/img/leaders/Baqner-mobile-768x1792.jpg","width":768,"height":1792,"type":"Retouched"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"4a56fe5713bdf50b5c1d1385244f3810421ef42ba37c1b2df6b895a4b21dd1de","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":16251144,"realCID":15962047,"demoCID":17512289,"username":"sean7t9","firstName":"Oluwaseun","middleName":null,"lastName":"Alo","language":1,"languageIsoCode":"en-GB","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I focus on building a consistent, risk-managed portfolio designed for long-term growth.\n\nMy strategy is centered on discipline, patience, and smart capital allocation—not hype or short-term speculation. I actively manage positions based on market conditions, using a structured approach to identify opportunities while controlling downside risk.\n\nI primarily invest across a mix of assets (stocks, indices, and selective opportunities) with the goal of achieving steady, compounding returns over time.\n\nWhat to expect when copying:\n- A low-to-moderate risk approach\n- Consistent portfolio management\n- Long-term growth focus\n- Clear, disciplined execution\n\nImportant guidelines for copiers:\n- Invest consistently (monthly additions help)\n- Avoid emotional reactions to short-term volatility\n- Allow time for the strategy to perform\n\nThis portfolio is built for investors who understand that wealth is created through consistency and time in the market—not quick wins.\n\nLet’s grow together.","aboutMeShort":"Disciplined, risk-managed strategy focused on steady long-term growth 📈","userBio":{"gcid":16251144,"aboutMe":"I focus on building a consistent, risk-managed portfolio designed for long-term growth.\n\nMy strategy is centered on discipline, patience, and smart capital allocation—not hype or short-term speculation. I actively manage positions based on market conditions, using a structured approach to identify opportunities while controlling downside risk.\n\nI primarily invest across a mix of assets (stocks, indices, and selective opportunities) with the goal of achieving steady, compounding returns over time.\n\nWhat to expect when copying:\n- A low-to-moderate risk approach\n- Consistent portfolio management\n- Long-term growth focus\n- Clear, disciplined execution\n\nImportant guidelines for copiers:\n- Invest consistently (monthly additions help)\n- Avoid emotional reactions to short-term volatility\n- Allow time for the strategy to perform\n\nThis portfolio is built for investors who understand that wealth is created through consistency and time in the market—not quick wins.\n\nLet’s grow together.","aboutMeShort":"Disciplined, risk-managed strategy focused on steady long-term growth 📈","languageCode":"en","strategyID":5},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/15962047/2.jpg","width":311,"height":311,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/15962047/2.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/15962047/2.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/15962047/2.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"9f30cf8dda79f2bedc8a6fa79d7be766b88bb22abcda6a7cdfcef2d784cdc283","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":31314342,"realCID":31030946,"demoCID":32522288,"username":"ronrwolf13","firstName":"RON","middleName":null,"lastName":"WOLF","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I have to say I’m still new in stock trading however I did buy 2 BTC in 2018 on my birthday for $12k per coin then after reading so much about ETH I purchased 5.6 of \nETH @ $1799 ea; and even after 4 yrs I'm holding on to both. Two days ago I bought Wolf, Nvda and Nio, and spent $4240.\nStill researching, in it to Win it, but\nThe Cavalry IS COMING” 🇺🇸😎","aboutMeShort":null,"userBio":{"gcid":31314342,"aboutMe":"I have to say I’m still new in stock trading however I did buy 2 BTC in 2018 on my birthday for $12k per coin then after reading so much about ETH I purchased 5.6 of \nETH @ $1799 ea; and even after 4 yrs I'm holding on to both. Two days ago I bought Wolf, Nvda and Nio, and spent $4240.\nStill researching, in it to Win it, but\nThe Cavalry IS COMING” 🇺🇸😎","aboutMeShort":null,"languageCode":"en","strategyID":0},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/31030946/1.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/31030946/1.jpg","width":35,"height":35,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/31030946/1.jpg","width":50,"height":50,"type":"Resized"},{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/31030946/1.jpg","width":150,"height":150,"type":"Resized"}],"masterAccountCid":null,"accountType":1,"fundType":null,"isVerified":true,"verificationLevel":3,"accountStatus":1,"gdprInfo":null,"userFlowSignature":"ba864cfe45c8463db8f23ce0790484faa98a82cdeac378acda07f9020558ff63","CustomerRestrictions":null},{"gcid":28773737,"realCID":28491064,"demoCID":29990944,"username":"ESDRASVasquez","firstName":"ESDRAS","middleName":null,"lastName":"Vasquez","language":25,"languageIsoCode":"en-US","country":219,"allowDisplayFullName":true,"aboutMe":"I’m an aggressive long-term investor with a horizon of 5 to 20 years. I focus on high-growth sectors like technology, crypto, and emerging markets. I believe in riding market cycles and taking calculated risks to maximize long-term returns. My strategy is built for those who can handle volatility and think big. \nSoy un inversor agresivo a largo plazo con un horizonte de 5 a 20 años. Me centro en sectores de alto crecimiento como la tecnología, las criptomonedas y los mercados emergentes. Creo en aprovechar los ciclos del mercado y asumir riesgos calculados para maximizar los rendimientos a largo plazo. Mi estrategia está diseñada para aquellos que pueden manejar la volatilidad y pensar en grande.\n\n","aboutMeShort":"HOLA YO SOY ESDRAS ","userBio":{"gcid":28773737,"aboutMe":"I’m an aggressive long-term investor with a horizon of 5 to 20 years. I focus on high-growth sectors like technology, crypto, and emerging markets. I believe in riding market cycles and taking calculated risks to maximize long-term returns. My strategy is built for those who can handle volatility and think big. \nSoy un inversor agresivo a largo plazo con un horizonte de 5 a 20 años. Me centro en sectores de alto crecimiento como la tecnología, las criptomonedas y los mercados emergentes. Creo en aprovechar los ciclos del mercado y asumir riesgos calculados para maximizar los rendimientos a largo plazo. Mi estrategia está diseñada para aquellos que pueden manejar la volatilidad y pensar en grande.\n\n","aboutMeShort":"HOLA YO SOY ESDRAS ","languageCode":"es","strategyID":null},"whiteLabel":9,"optOut":false,"homepage":null,"playerStatus":null,"piLevel":0,"isPi":false,"isProInvestor":false,"avatars":[{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/original/28491064/1.jpg","width":310,"height":310,"type":"Original"}